Yale Bright Star Catalog, 5th Revised Edition (BSC5)
----------------------------------------------------
    native/organon-render/src/BSC5   (~292 KB, binary)

Embedded verbatim and parsed at runtime by `organon-render`'s `stars.rs`, which
draws the HDR starfield. 9,110 entries; the file is the standard binary format
distributed by the Astronomical Data Center.

    Hoffleit, D. & Warren, W. H., Jr. (1991),
    "The Bright Star Catalogue, 5th Revised Edition"
    Yale University Observatory.

The catalogue is a scientific reference dataset published for unrestricted
scholarly use and carries no licence text of its own. It is included here with
attribution, unmodified. If you redistribute Organon, keep this notice.


